## Crop yield data

Annual crop yield data were obtained from the FAOSTAT Crops and
Livestock Products database:

https://www.fao.org/faostat/

The following filters were used:

- Area: Türkiye
- Element: Yield
- Period: 2000–2024
- Unit: kg/ha
- Accessed: 29 June 2026

The analysis includes Apples, Barley, Beans, Grapes, Maize, Olives,
Potatoes, Rice, Sugar beet, Tomatoes, and Wheat.
